        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_bulldog.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e3b820e1-001b-401a-b7f7-633e66fcdc7f).Image",
        "Description": "The ferry is waiting by the shore, but the path to liberation is securely locked. Three souls in the garden have overstayed their welcome, and it seems they are holding the very thing you need to depart.\r\rDeliver a tight, silent farewell to all three, and ensure their final resting places are properly boxed and archived — two within the glass house, one by the water. Bring the necessary means to breach the locked sanctuary, claim the boatman&apos;s missing token, and cross the river before anyone not",
